<title>USA: Banks Sch Dist 13, Ore., yields 5.50 pct in 2017.</title>
<headline>Banks Sch Dist 13, Ore., yields 5.50 pct in 2017.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said it tentatively priced $6.100 million of Banks School District No 13, Ore., general obligation bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.50 percent in 2017.</p>
